+    "text": "Announced in reports/IMPL_A_REPORT.md for this stage: the protocol does not say what L3 and L5 count on TEST. Implemented: L4 on every instantiated TEST question (verbatim in train_F, train_S, train_Y, anchor_text); L3a, L3b and L5 re-run as at Gate 0 (they read no TEST content, so the TEST part cannot change them); L6 TEST part as protocol section 3.",
